<title>USA: Harcourt sets 1-for-100 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Harcourt sets 1-for-100 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harcourt Symes Inc said its board of directors authorized a one-for-100 reverse stock split.</p>
<p>The company said it is positioning itself for &quot;a more advantageous market price and the overall trading activity&quot; of its common shares.</p>
<p>Effective and record dates were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
